{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"title":1,"excerpt":2,"tags":3,"film":6},"Le Poireau perpétuel","Un journal filmé qui commence le cinq mars. Tous les ans à cette date précise, une fourmi entre sous ma porte et je l’observe. Pour elle, c’est l’arrivée du printemps pour moi c’est l’anniversaire de ma mère. La fourmi nourrit sa reine qui aura des œufs et moi je me pose la question d’avoir un enfant ou pas au moment où ma mère, atteinte d’un cancer, entame sa décroissance de vie.",[4,5],"motherhood","physical illness",{"type":7,"id":8,"slug":9,"title":10,"release":12,"filmType":16,"directors":17,"genre":26,"media":28,"synopsis":31,"production":32,"characters":35,"roles":36,"awards":41,"tags":3},"Film","FR2023_210","fr2023-210-le-poireau-perpetuel",{"native":1,"english":11},"",{"type":13,"date":14,"year":15},"Theatrical release","2023-11-22",2023,"Documentary",[18],{"id":19,"slug":20,"name":19,"birthYear":21,"deathYear":22,"gender":23,"nationality":24,"awards":25},"Zoé Chantre","zoe-chantre",1981,0,"Female identifying","France",[],[27],"Documentary – Performative mode",{"posterUrl":29,"trailerUrl":30},"https://medias.unifrance.org/medias/237/38/272109/format_page/le-poireau-perpetuel.jpg","https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ytuIIQ8Lefo",{"native":2,"english":11},[33],{"country":24,"share":34},"Majority coproducer",[],[37],{"person":38,"role":40},{"id":19,"slug":20,"name":19,"birthYear":21,"deathYear":22,"gender":23,"nationality":24,"awards":39},[],"Director of the film",[]],"uses":{"params":["slug"]}}]}
